 2804+6A78              .dir_search_len_ge2:
 2805+6A78                      ; Is the LAST byte of the name still inside the same physical window?
 2806+6A78                      ; last = HL + BC - 1
 2807+6A78                      ; Carry means that the name crosses #FFFF -> #C000, therefore use the
 2808+6A78                      ; fully bank-safe (but slower) routine below.
 2809+6A78 E5                   push    hl
 2810+6A79 C5                   push    bc
